      511.87,
      534.05,
      575.5
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 19 July 2026 Several spells of showers will occur in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
