    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      620.77,
      380.06,
      642.31
    ],
    "text": "Mainly dry weather will prevail over the other areas of the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      647.71,
      533.89,
      701.38
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of Central hills, Northern, North-central, Central and North-western provinces and in Rathnapura, Hambantota and Trincomalee districts.",
    "fonts": [
